    "body": "## Summary\n\nAdds EAGLE3 and DFlash speculative decoding support to two multimodal models by delegating the required hooks to their nested text backbone:\n\n- **Qwen2-Audio** (`qwen2_audio.py`): delegate `get_embed_and_head` / `set_eagle3_layers_to_capture` (EAGLE3) and `get_input_embeddings` / `set_dflash_layers_to_capture` / `lm_head` (DFlash) to `self.language_model`\n- **Qwen3-Omni** (`qwen3_omni_moe.py`): same delegation pattern, targeting `self.thinker`\n- **Qwen2** (`qwen2.py`): add missing `set_dflash_layers_to_capture` method that `Qwen2Audio` and `Qwen3Omni` now delegate to\n\nNo changes to forward logic — the text backbone already threads captured aux-hidden states through its `LogitsProcessor`, so the multimodal wrappers need only expose the hook entry points.\n\n## Performance\n\nMeasured on 1×H100, tp=1, greedy, concurrency=1. All results are lossless (no accuracy regression).\n\n| Model | Method | Dataset | Accept len | Speedup |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Qwen2-Audio-7B | EAGLE3 (steps=3, draft=4) | AISHELL test | 3.37 | **1.65×** |\n| Qwen2-Audio-7B | DFlash block-4 (draft=4) | AISHELL test | 3.29 | **1.58×** |\n| Qwen3-Omni-30B-A3B | EAGLE3 multi-domain (steps=3, draft=4) | LibriSpeech test-clean | 3.12 | **1.49×** |\n| Qwen3-Omni-30B-A3B | DFlash multi-domain block-6 (draft=6) | LibriSpeech test-clean | 4.15 | **1.60×** |\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #30619957560](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/30619957560)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #30619956828](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/30619956828)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
